# Copy to .env.local and fill in. NEVER commit real values.
# The live TDSP Supabase project is used (no local Supabase). Values come from
# the Supabase dashboard (Project Settings > API). Do not paste them in chat.

# Public values (safe for the browser).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY= is also accepted for older projects.

# Server-only secret. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_, never import in client code.
# Not used yet; reserved for later admin-only server code.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
